'''Wishiwashi ex''' (Japanese: '''ヨワシex''' ''Yowashi ex'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

