==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Wishiwashi}} in its {{form|Wishiwashi|School Form}}; two Wishiwashi in their Solo Form can also be seen on the special illustration rare card.
*'''School Storm''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Wishiwashi-GX|63}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.

